\f0\b \cf0 financial transactions are the only
\f1\b0 \
  
\f0\b domain in human life where expectations and outcomes are stamped in exact dollars, exact seconds, and immutable
\f1\b0 \
  
\f0\b ledgers.
\f1\b0  \
\
  There are no squishy subjective surveys or "rate your feelings from 1 to 10." A financial transaction has an exact\
  contractual expectation (E), an exact settled validation (V), and a measurable mismatch (\uc0\u949  = V - E).\
\
  However, there is a crucial scientific distinction you must make between 
\f0\b measuring financial stress
\f1\b0  and 
\f0\b measuring
\f1\b0 \
  
\f0\b trust
\f1\b0 :\
\
  ---\
\
  
\f0\b 1. The Distinction: Stress vs. Trust
\f1\b0 \
\
   * 
\f0\b Financial Health / Bill-Day Test = Measuring Channels C & A (Stress & Arousal):
\f1\b0 \
       * When you measure someone on the day their rent or bills are due, you are measuring 
\f0\b allostatic load, executive
\f1\b0 \
         
\f0\b fatigue, and cognitive scarcity
\f1\b0  (the Cortisol and Adrenaline channels in DOCAS).\
       * 
\f2\i What this gives you:
\f1\i0  It proves the environmental baseline\'97that financial pressure physically exhausts\
         prefrontal bandwidth and suppresses HRV.\
   * 
\f0\b Trust = The Active Prediction Loop with a Counterparty (E \uc0\u8594  V \u8594  \u949  \u8594  \u916  S):
\f1\b0 \
       * Trust is 
\f0\b directional and relational
\f1\b0 . You do not just "have trust" in the void; you trust a 
\f2\i specific
\f1\i0 \
         
\f2\i counterparty
\f1\i0  (your bank, your landlord, an employer, a lender, or a trading partner) to fulfill an agreement.\
       * To measure 
\f2\i trust
\f1\i0 , you need an 
\f0\b event where an expectation is tested against reality
\f1\b0 .\
\
  If you only measure people paying scheduled bills, you are measuring the 
\f2\i metabolic cost of living under scarcity
\f1\i0 . \
\
  To measure 
\f0\b trust itself
\f1\b0 , you need to capture the 
\f0\b mismatch moment (\uc0\u949 _t = V
\f3\b0 \uc0\u8348 
\f0\b  - E
\f3\b0 \uc0\u8348 
\f0\b )
\f1\b0 .\
\
  ---\
\
  
\f0\b 2. How Financial Data Gives the Cleanest Trust Signal in Existence
\f1\b0 \
\
  Because financial transactions are timestamped to the millisecond and quantified to the penny, they turn theoretical\
  trust math into hard physics:\
\
    1 The Financial Trust Loop in Real Life:\
    2\
    3        [ Contract / Promise ] \uc0\u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 
\f4 \uc0\u9658 
\f1   Expectation E_t ($120 scheduled bill)\
    4                  \uc0\u9474 \
    5                  \uc0\u9660 \
    6        [ Clearing Event ]    \uc0\u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 
\f4 \uc0\u9658 
\f1   Validation V_t  ($165 debited; $45 hidden fee)\
    7                  \uc0\u9474 \
    8                  \uc0\u9660 \
    9      [ Prediction Error ]    \uc0\u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 
\f4 \uc0\u9658 
\f1   \uc0\u949 _t = V_t - E_t = -$45 (BETRAYAL SHOCK)\
   10                  \uc0\u9474 \
   11                  \uc0\u9660 \
   12       [ Neural & Autonomic ] \uc0\u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 
\f4 \uc0\u9658 
\f1   Muse Frontal Alpha / Apple Watch HRV Drop\
   13                  \uc0\u9474 \
   14                  \uc0\u9660 \
   15     [ Master Stability Law ] \uc0\u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 
\f4 \uc0\u9658 
\f1   \uc0\u916 S_t = \u955  \'b7 \u949 _t  (Permanent Standing Drop)\
\
  In any bank feed, there are three distinct classes of financial events that cleanly map to your equations:\
\
   1. 
\f0\b Expected Fulfillment (\uc0\u949  \u8776  0):
\f1\b0 \
       * Your \\80 utility bill debits exactly \\80 on the scheduled day. \
       * 
\f2\i Neural Signal:
\f1\i0  Low cognitive friction, resting autonomic stability. Minor oxytocin/reinforcement confirmation.\
   2. 
\f0\b Negative Prediction Error / Betrayal (\uc0\u949  
\f5\b0 \uc0\u8810 
\f0\b  0):
\f1\b0 \
