\f1\b0 \
  
\f0\b 104$)
\f1\b0 , tracking his own gene expression, coffee intake, mood, and brain connectivity.\
\
   * 
\f0\b Why it was a scientific sensation:
\f1\b0  In traditional studies with 30 different people, individual biological\
     differences (skull shape, personality, baseline genetics) create massive "between-subject noise" that washes out\
     subtle dynamic patterns.\
