\f0\b dense, continuous tracking of one human reveals the actual dynamical trajectory of how a
\f1\b0 \
     
\f0\b brain changes over time
\f1\b0 \'97something a cross-sectional study of 30 strangers can 
\f2\i never
\f1\i0  show.\
